  "The post says 'some of the hunters above I accidently put ECC instead of EJP': 'Dengar ECC' dested Dengar With Blaster Carbine and 'Bossk ECC' Bossk With Mortar Gun (the Enhanced Jabba's Palace premiums); 'IG-88 ECC' IG-88 With Riot Gun and '4-LOM ECC' 4-LOM With Concussion Rifle (the Enhanced Cloud City premiums).",
